	(gr_text "PCB thickness is 1.6 mm +/. 10%.\nIPC-A-600 allows a bow and twist of 0.75%.\nThe standoff height bellow component pad can go from 0 to 0.1 mm.\n\n\nMax. PCB thickness 1.6 mm * 10% = 0.16 mm\nMax. Bow and twist 135 mm * 0.075% = 1.01 mm\nMax. standoff height = 0.1 mm\n\nMax. TOTAL = 1.27 mm\n\n\nThe {dblquote}B.Silkscreen{dblquote} line shows the nominal PCB position.\nFor reference only, the {dblquote}User.Drawings{dblquote} line includes the maximum PCB thickness\ntolerance, bow and twist, and standoff height.\n\n\nThe nominal PCB position was calculated from the box datasheet with the\nlower holes as reference.\nThe distance from the hole is 3.4 + 1.9 + 2.2 = 7.5 mm"
		(at 24.702452 175.944572 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
